WEBVTT

00:02:29.538 --> 00:02:31.329
That land we lost in Minnesota,

00:02:31.329 --> 00:02:35.329
the Enbridge's Line 3 pipeline
goes right through the middle of it.

00:02:35.996 --> 00:02:41.079
That freaking pipeline is responsible
for the largest inland oil spill

00:02:41.121 --> 00:02:42.829
ever recorded in the US.

00:02:43.371 --> 00:02:46.204
And now they're trying to expand it.

00:02:47.746 --> 00:02:50.954
Whether we're talking pipelines
or some other industry,

00:02:50.954 --> 00:02:54.829
the colonial mindset has been
about extracting resources,

00:02:55.579 --> 00:02:58.079
mostly with the goal of making
the rich richer.

00:02:59.204 --> 00:03:02.413
But that's why Landback
is not about Indigenous people